---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>A Universal, Executable, Sonorous, and Cryptographic Language.</h1>
    <p>Built on 20 semantic primitives across 5 ontological layers (L0-L4). It compiles to Python and WebAssembly, renders deterministic SVG glyphs, synthesizes audio via the Web Audio API, and seals every state change with SHA-256 and OpenTimestamps.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="/demo" class="btn">Explore the Agentic Glyph</a>
      <a href="/whitepaper.html" class="btn" style="background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--text);">Read the Whitepaper</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2>Architecture</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>L0 (Formal Logic):</strong> EXIST, SAME, ONE, ALL, NOT, IF, TRUE</li>
    <li><strong>L1 (Physical Causality):</strong> CAUSE, PART, BIG</li>
    <li><strong>L2 (Event and Action):</strong> DO, HAPPEN, MOVE</li>
    <li><strong>L3 (Cognition):</strong> KNOW, SEE, THINK, SAY</li>
    <li><strong>L4 (Life and Value):</strong> LIVE, DIE, GOOD</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
